//! Controls whether underline, overline, and line-through decorations cross spaces, including
//! decorations inherited from ancestors.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - all: Omits decorations across all spaces.
//! - end: Omits decorations across spaces at the end of each line.
//! - none: Draws decorations across spaces.
//! - start: Omits decorations across spaces at the start of each line.
//!
//! Grammar: none | all | [ start || end ]
//!
